From 43adf52e593021a098ec4e1bddd0197662cde506 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Siddhartha Srivastava <siddhartha@delphai.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:28:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] UWC devnet: real-PoW network, job-state RPCs, job coinbase
 outputs in getblocktemplate, uwcctl keys (build step 7)

- chaincfg.UWCDevNetParams (--uwcdevnet): own magic (UWCD), genesis, ports 18670/18671,
  proof verification on (unlike SimNet), 1-minute blocks with WTEMA retargeting, job module
  with a 2-of-3 council.
- RPCs getjobstate, getjob, listjobs, getjobaccount, getcategory (read-only).
- getblocktemplate returns uwc_coinbase_outputs (pool deposit, due withdrawals, job-state
  commitment); Pearl's gateway appends them to the coinbase it builds.
- cmd/uwcctl: Taproot keys and their job-module accounts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Li1NuWZZGrbS2dbWLqQUj
